;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\雷雨.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―It's past noon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The thunder has eased off somewhat, but this rain probably won't stop for a while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The road between here and Arata Station must be in pretty bad shape by now too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\女神\スマフォ青切血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My bloodstained phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It reacts a little, but it won't work well enough for me to contact <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The blood must have gotten all the way into the machinery inside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't exactly have <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto's</STYLE> numbers memorized, so I can't call from the house's landline either.<PG>
Here, it's just the two of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In front of me,
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
that mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looks like it's been dead a long time.<PG>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey... who are you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Why are you in a place like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But of course it can't answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't even tell from its face whether it died in agony or had a peaceful end.<PG>
Will <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and the others get to Arata Station around 4 p.m.?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mountain road's probably a muddy torrent by now, so they'll likely turn right back around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, this is <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> we're talking about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She might stay in the storage shed at Arata Station or something and wait for the road to firm up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, I'd better go meet them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With my legs, I can manage even on a sloppy road.<PG>
Before then, I have to figure out what happened in this settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like to borrow <STYLE ID="2">Goto's</STYLE> powers of deduction too, but I can't have her come to a place like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, this is the Arata settlement's problem and nobody else's.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no need to drag those two into a mess like this.<PG>
Where should I start?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe the quickest way is the mummy right in front of me, and finding the culprit who attacked me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The culprit can't have been trying to make it look like the mummy did it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's the kind of idea a child would have.<PG>
A child...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The youngest child in this settlement is
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE>, who starts middle school this year, might still be at the prank-loving age.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, it could be <STYLE ID="4">Kana's</STYLE> doing, but...<PG>
In the 2 years I haven't seen her, has <STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE> turned into that much of a rotten little brat?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, probably not.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way a kid could get hold of a mummy like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The quality's way too high for a kid's prank.<PG>
So it's an adult's doing after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To varying degrees, but if we're talking about someone who loves pranks,
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ指さしバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
it's <STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE>, who passed away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe <STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE> became a ghost and gave me a rough welcome...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, that'd be fun in its own way, but I need reasoning that's a little more realistic...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then that would make <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE>, or <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> suspicious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, wait, there was something that bugged me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The leap in interpretation about the settlement perishing―the part about 'being destroyed by people from outside.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd been thinking that was strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, I'll try sorting it out again from around there.<PG>
First, let me think through what <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> did, in order.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And let me assume <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san's</STYLE> intuition and <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> are the same thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case, a few days ago <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san</STYLE> must have realized that someone in this settlement would be in danger.<PG>
If she foresaw that everyone in the settlement would be in danger, then the settlement perishes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yeah, I can follow that much. Maybe every resident had the look of death on them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But how do you get from there to the idea that 'people from outside will destroy the settlement'?<PG>
In <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> case, she only judged whether what came next was dangerous or not.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, she couldn't tell 'why it was dangerous' or 'how it was dangerous.'<PG>
Maybe <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san's</STYLE> intuition is better than <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE>, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If so, I should've gotten the whole story on that from <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I also need to think about the difference between <STYLE ID="6">Sakura-san's</STYLE> intuition and <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> intuition, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dammit... no matter what, I always hit a wall right around here.<PG>
If I can't use my head, I'll just have to use my legs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll check whether everyone really has vanished.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there anywhere all of them could hide?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's it... that's it! If danger's coming, it wouldn't be weird for them to have evacuated somewhere!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's gotta be a hideout somewhere!<PG>
And in this rain, too. There aren't many places where all 30 people could hide.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They weren't in the meeting hall, so maybe some big rocky spot, or a secret cave.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyway, somewhere out of the rain.<PG>
Okay, there's time before <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and the others get here, so I'll search every corner of this settlement starting now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No... 
{PAUSE ""}
before that...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey... who are you? Why did you suddenly show up in a place like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whoever hit me <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="つ">hung</STYLE> this mummy up and made my phone useless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What was the culprit trying to tell me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For just a scare stunt, it's, how do I put it... 
{PAUSE ""}
like it has too strong a message, or something...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't really want to, but I guess I'll take a proper look at this mummy too.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Earlier I pulled the red robes off it in the heat of the moment, but this dried-up mummy is so light that one wrong move could make it crumble.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Touching it gives me a gut-level revulsion, but I've got plenty of experience butchering mountain animals, so it doesn't bother me that much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, <STYLE ID="10">Mom</STYLE> went through the mountain seclusion too, so that's how she could do something like <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="は">skin</STYLE> a human being...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This body's missing an eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In one socket the eyeball has dried and sunk in, but in the other, there's no eyeball at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it's a <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="せきがん">one-eyed</STYLE> corpse...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Its sex... 
{PAUSE ""}
yeah, this body is definitely female.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As for age, maybe around puberty?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For her height, her chest and lower belly still look childish.<PG>
The mummy of a girl missing one eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And this body was probably resting somewhere in the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In exchange for this one suddenly showing up, the residents vanished.<PG>
If she was around puberty, was the cause of death an accident or murder rather than illness?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did this one die with her eye gouged out?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or were her eyes like this since long before she died?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, this isn't a mummy that looks like it lived a happy life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A body that was never cremated or buried, just preserved all this time, suddenly showed up in a place like this.<PG>
Somehow, when I think of it like that... I feel sorry for this mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl at puberty lost her eye and died young.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she ended up a mummy, she must be from a pretty long time ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Made into a mummy for some purpose, and on top of that, dragged out in front of me in the present day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A mummy treated so arbitrarily... like she's done nothing but be used.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey... are you maybe from hundreds of years ago?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Why were you made into a mummy and dragged out to a place like this?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Why... are you missing an eye?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... Want to know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart leaps with a start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Out of nowhere, from directly behind―right at my back, a person's voice.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... So you came back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Where've you been! And what is this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grab <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> by both shoulders and shake her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> expression doesn't change.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... What happened to watching Arata Station?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's not important right now! Where'd everybody go!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　What's with this mummy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">... Everyone will hear you if you shout, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Answer the question!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh... gaah...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
An unbearable pain shoots through my solar plexus.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that pain, my legs buckle and give way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> just... hit me...!?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, I told you, didn't I?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Danger is closing in on this settlement. Don't make a fuss over trivial things."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This one...! Is she really <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She sees the mummy right in front of her and feels nothing...!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> crouches in front of me as I double over―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\茅萱春花髪.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
and grabs my bangs and yanks them up hard enough to tear them out.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, short hair really does suit you better."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"Let... go...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>Between the searing pain in my solar plexus and my bangs being yanked up, I can't move freely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The pain in my solar plexus makes me want to curl up, but having my face forced up makes it really hard to breathe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is doing this on purpose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's deliberately putting me in a painful position, plotting something.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"So that's it...! The one who hit me earlier was you too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, right...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... What are you talking about?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Don't play dumb!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From where I'm lying face-down, I clench my fist and drive it up at <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my fist hits nothing and turns into a breeze.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\茅萱背後.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
