{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, with that, did you really train in the mountain seclusion?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What...!? Was that sarcasm!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time, so she can't dodge, I throw a spinning back kick with my left leg.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And it's a roundhouse aimed low, at her feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll make her jump to dodge it and get <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> body up in the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That way she can't dodge my next attack.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "20" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "NORMAL"}
