{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\茅萱春花押さえつけ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "7!" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "1000"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh... ggh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd meant to use the momentum of the left-leg roundhouse to throw a right front kick.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my body was pinned flat to the tatami like a spider in a specimen case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Face-down, with both shoulders and my head held down, I can't move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The strain on my joints is more than I'd expect from someone as light as <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, settle down. I don't like violence, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Much less do I want to pick on the weak."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Who...! Who are you calling weak...!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you were alone on the mountain, so you have no experience at all fighting people. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">We played at fighting almost every day ever since </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> started carrying weapons, and even after I went to Tokyo, I never once missed sparring with </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> when I came home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Dammit...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, all you've done is face beasts. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">To me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you're the same as a beast to be hunted, you know?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　So what I'm doing now is just picking on the weak."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sh... shut up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... So, be quiet."</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "3" "3" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\bakibaki.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "900" "0"}
My face is forced sideways, and my <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE> has <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> knee grinding into it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My mouth is forced open, so I can't even talk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Drool leaks sloppily out of my mouth.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, I'll say it one more time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, everyone may be wary of you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">So you mustn't make </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> presence known. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Watch Arata Station, go back to the mountain, or stay here quietly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">What will you do? If you'll help, I'd welcome it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"Egh... gegh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>I wanted to keep complaining, but with my mouth forced open like a suffocating fish, I can't get a proper word out.<PG>
Dammit...! Okay, I get it, I get it...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll talk calmly...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's true I was doing nothing but laying into <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, and I wasn't making it a mood where we could actually talk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{MESON "500"}
As if she heard that inner voice, <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> slowly got off me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Dammit, that hurt..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I get up, wiping off my drool.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I thought I'd gotten stronger in the mountain seclusion, but in front of <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> I'm no better than a baby.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that's <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, who moved to Tokyo. <STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE> might be even stronger.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, what will you do?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Arata Station? The mountain? Here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was hoping she'd apologize at least a little for what she did to me, but there's no sign of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her tone and expression, exactly the same as always, are what's creepy.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, hold on... If I can't understand the situation at least a little, I don't know what to do. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Can't you tell me anything...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For the first time, <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> expression changed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though only to the point of narrowing her eyes a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her two blue eyes fall into the shadow of her narrowed lids and look dark.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, what do you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="8">think of the customs here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"The customs...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... In the Arata settlement, Japanese and Westerners have lived side by side since long ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Now, both the blood and the culture are completely mixed."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know that much..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... The religion of this Arata settlement is a little unusual. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Witches conduct the memorial services, the dead are called shinigami― </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">But don't you think it's strange? The most important thing is missing."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What? Don't keep me hanging..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, who do you always pray to?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Pray?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Ghost長い.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... In this Arata religion, there's no god to pray to. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">This settlement has no god to be an object of worship."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No... god...?"</STYLE><PG>
The logic that it's weird to have no object of worship doesn't really click for me, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never cared about that kind of thing; at memorial services I always just thought of the person who'd died and prayed for their soul.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the idea of who to pray to, or who to worship, never occurred to me.<PG>
So what <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> means is that there's a religious culture, but no clear object of worship.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In Shinto, people worship the <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="やおよろず">eight million</STYLE> gods, or there's animism, or all of creation, but is that no good?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I moved here, I heard from <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE> that the tenth-year memorial in the Arata settlement is something unique to Shinto that Buddhism doesn't have.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The way Shinto sees it, gods live in everything, so isn't it fine not to have one particular god?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　That's normal for polytheism, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, that's a big mistake. The faith of Arata is monotheistic. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">We simply didn't know. There really was a god."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> turned her eyes to the mummy lying on the floor.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "$000080" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... She is this settlement's god, the one who was called 'Verde.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">A 14-year-old girl who died more than 400 years ago, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Verde...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Clearly not a Japanese name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, where did a god like this spring up from?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does it have to do with the destruction of the settlement?<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, the god is dead. The one who protected this settlement is gone now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"A mummy's dead to begin with..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> looks at the rope still hanging there, and the loop the mummy's neck had been through.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... From the look of this, Lady Verde was </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="つ">hanging</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> by the neck a little while ago, wasn't she?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　Which means Lady Verde has died twice. The first time as a human, the second time as a god."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> is saying is gradually losing touch with reality.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, this violent <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> herself doesn't feel real, and what she's saying sounds way too much like delusional ravings.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"A threat has already gotten into this settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">A threat that kills the Goddess and drives this settlement to destruction. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">A goddess-killing threat."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9" RUBY="つ">Hanging</STYLE> the mummy should be nothing more than a performance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But to <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, it's a threat, and she seems to take it as a declaration of war on the settlement.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... Now, what will you do?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　The station? The mountain? Here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's all the explanation I get...!? Now I'm even more confused...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But asking this <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> anything is probably pointless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The person in front of me who looks like <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> isn't the person I know.<PG>
I don't believe the settlement is going wrong because this god Verde died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because ever since I came to this settlement this morning―
{PAUSE ""}
before Verde ever <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="つ">hanged</STYLE> herself, things were already off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's got to be something weird going on, done by human hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't believe in curses anymore...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm going back to the station. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'll probably be harder for everyone to find there than here, and I can be useful too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... All right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> starts to leave the room just like that.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, wait. Where did everyone else go?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　I searched all over the settlement just now, and nobody was there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Mm... What are you talking about? Everyone is inside their houses."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee's</STYLE> words, which flatly denied everything I'd said, I couldn't even get out a word to stop her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that what <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and I are seeing... are different things?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> can see things I can't...?<PG>
But...
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\女神\ミイラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> could see this Verde mummy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is the Arata settlement's object of faith, dead more than 400 years?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A religion that worships a mummy, or rather a corpse...<PG>
No, I can't say for sure that's strange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The custom of calling the dead shinigami is still deeply rooted, and they're dressed in Noh masks and big overgarments.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Verde's getup is exactly a shinigami's too, so you could say Verde herself is a shinigami.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So does that mean they worship a shinigami...?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\E3839BE383A9E383BC3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "$0000FF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n150\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
This is nothing but devil worship...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, why did this Verde become an object of faith?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It can't be that this one put a curse on the settlement.<PG>
Besides, if she was kept outside the settlement, couldn't you call this one an outsider too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if she showed up today, April 8...<PG>
Unfortunately, this is as far as I can get on my own.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's nobody in this settlement except <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="8">Chiga-nee</STYLE> herself doesn't seem like someone I can rely on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that case...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do is borrow the strength of <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Goto</STYLE>...<PG>
No, there's no way I could drag them into something like this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... I could at least have them hear me out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't bring them here, but I want any clue I can get.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi's</STYLE> intuition and <STYLE ID="2">Goto's</STYLE> brains...
